+# Chip variant is consumed by sx126x_ral_bsp.c in drivers/usp, which is a
+# different zephyr_library(). Library-local defs never reach that BSP, so
+# ral_sx126x_bsp_get_tx_cfg() falls back to the SX1261 PA (device_sel=1,
